---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section id="infraestructura" class="on-dark relative bg-deep noise gridlines inner-depth text-[#EAF1F8] py-[96px] overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
  <div data-px="0.08" class="absolute -top-24 right-[8%] w-[420px] h-[420px] rounded-full bg-cy/12 blur-[130px] z-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div data-px="-0.05" class="absolute bottom-[-120px] left-[4%] w-[460px] h-[460px] rounded-full bg-[#1B74E4]/18 blur-[140px] z-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative z-10 wrap">
    <div class="max-w-[860px] mx-auto text-center mb-12 reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Infraestructura incluida</span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase text-[clamp(1.45rem,3.1vw,2.25rem)] leading-snug mt-4 mb-3 drop-shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,.6)]">Todo lo que tu sitio necesita para funcionar bien, incluido <span class="text-yel">desde el día uno</span></h2>
      <p class="text-[#9FB0C2] text-[1rem]">Cada plan de hosting incluye todo esto desde el primer día: sin costos ocultos ni extras sorpresa.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-[1020px] mx-auto">
      <div class="flipbox reveal d1">
        <div class="flipbox-inner">
          <div class="flipbox-face flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-yel/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1B1A0A] to-[#0B0F1A] p-6 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(255,230,0,.10)]">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-7 h-7 stroke-yel" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 00.34 1.87l.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.7 1.7 0 00-1.87-.34 1.7 1.7 0 00-1 1.55V21a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.09a1.7 1.7 0 00-1-1.55 1.7 1.7 0 00-1.87.34l-.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.7 1.7 0 00.34-1.87 1.7 1.7 0 00-1.55-1H3a2 2 0 110-4h.09a1.7 1.7 0 001.55-1 1.7 1.7 0 00-.34-1.87l-.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83-2.83l.06.06a1.7 1.7 0 001.87.34h.09a1.7 1.7 0 001-1.55V3a2 2 0 114 0v.09a1.7 1.7 0 001 1.55 1.7 1.7 0 001.87-.34l.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.7 1.7 0 00-.34 1.87v.09a1.7 1.7 0 001.55 1H21a2 2 0 110 4h-.09a1.7 1.7 0 00-1.55 1z"/></svg>
            <h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.95rem] text-yel">Actualización de plugins y plantillas</h3>
            <p class="text-[.84rem] text-[#9FB0C2]">Mantener todo al día evita fallos y huecos de seguridad.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flipbox-face flipbox-back flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-cy/50 bg-[#0B0F1A] p-6 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,210,255,.10)]">
            <p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#C8D3DF]">Revisamos y aplicamos actualizaciones críticas para que tu sitio permanezca seguro y funcional. <b class="text-cyt">¿Necesitas una web nueva o con mantención? Cotiza tu sitio con nosotros.</b></p>
            <a href={`${base}/cotizador`} class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.85rem] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md transition-all shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(255,230,0,.25)]">Cotizar sitio web</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flipbox reveal d2">
        <div class="flipbox-inner">
          <div class="flipbox-face flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-yel/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1B1A0A] to-[#0B0F1A] p-6 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(255,230,0,.10)]">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-7 h-7 stroke-yel" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 00-5.4 5.4L3 17.5V21h3.5l6.2-6.3a4 4 0 005.4-5.4l-2.9 2.9-2.1-2.1z"/></svg>
            <h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.95rem] text-yel">Corrección de errores en tu sitio</h3>
            <p class="text-[.84rem] text-[#9FB0C2]">Ajustamos enlaces rotos, formularios y detalles visuales.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flipbox-face flipbox-back flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-cy/50 bg-[#0B0F1A] p-6 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,210,255,.10)]">
            <p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#C8D3DF]">Cuando algo falla tras una actualización, lo revisamos y lo solucionamos rápidamente. <b class="text-cyt">Si tu sitio no está con nosotros, cotiza su corrección y migración.</b></p>
            <a href={`${base}/cotizador`} class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.85rem] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md transition-all shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(255,230,0,.25)]">Cotizar sitio web</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flipbox reveal d3">
        <div class="flipbox-inner">
          <div class="flipbox-face flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-yel/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1B1A0A] to-[#0B0F1A] p-6 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(255,230,0,.10)]">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-7 h-7 stroke-yel" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 10-4.5-1.5-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            <h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.95rem] text-yel">Si tu sitio sufre un hackeo, lo recuperamos</h3>
            <p class="text-[.84rem] text-[#9FB0C2]">Restauramos desde respaldo y blindamos la seguridad.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flipbox-face flipbox-back flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-cy/50 bg-[#0B0F1A] p-6 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,210,255,.10)]">
            <p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#C8D3DF]">Restauramos desde respaldo, limpiamos malware y blindamos la seguridad del sitio. <b class="text-cyt">¿Tu web necesita protección? Pídenos una cotización hoy.</b></p>
            <a href={`${base}/cotizador`} class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.85rem] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md transition-all shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(255,230,0,.25)]">Cotizar sitio web</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-center text-[.9rem] text-[#EFE9C8] mt-4 mb-8 reveal">Para sitios desarrollados por nosotros y alojados con nosotros.</p>
    <div id="infraGrid" class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-[1020px] mx-auto">
      <div class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="18" height="7" rx="2"/><path d="M7 7.5h.01M7 16.5h.01"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Panel de control cPanel</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Administra tu sitio, correos y bases de datos desde un solo lugar.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9s1.3-6.4 3.8-9z"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Datacenter en Estados Unidos y Cono Sur</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Infraestructura estable, pensada para velocidad de carga real.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Optimizado para WordPress</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Configuración optimizada para que tu sitio responda rápido.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Respaldos diarios (hasta 15)</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Copias de seguridad frecuentes de tu sitio y tus correos.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Correo corporativo gratis</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Cuentas @tuempresa.cl configuradas y listas para usar.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 018 0v3"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">SSL gratis</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">El candado de seguridad activo en tu sitio desde el primer día.</p></div></div>
      <div data-more-item hidden class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">LiteSpeed Cache</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Tecnología de caché que acelera los tiempos de carga.</p></div></div>
      <div data-more-item hidden class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">WordPress en 1 clic (Softaculous)</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Instala WordPress y otras plataformas sin conocimientos técnicos.</p></div></div>
      <div data-more-item hidden class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0118 0M2 12h5v8H2zM17 12h5v8h-5z"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Soporte directo</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Siempre termina atendiéndote una persona, en horario de atención.</p></div></div>
      <div data-more-item hidden class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 10-4.5-1.5-8-5-8-10V6l8-4zM12 9v4M12 16.5h.01"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Protección hack y malware</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Monitoreo constante para detectar amenazas antes de que afecten tu sitio.</p></div></div>
      <div data-more-item hidden class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h8M4 8h6M4 16h6M14 8l6 8M20 8l-6 8"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Migración gratuita y sin cortes de servicio</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Movemos tu sitio, correos y base de datos desde tu hosting actual.</p></div></div>
      <div data-more-item hidden class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-[#0D1420]/80 border border-cy/15 hover:border-cy/50 rounded-lg p-5 hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,.45)] reveal d3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" class="w-[22px] h-[22px] stroke-cy shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/><path d="M9 15h6"/></svg><div><h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[.9rem] mb-1">Correo corporativo con tu dominio</h3><p class="text-[.86rem] text-[#93A3B4]">Lo configuramos nosotros, sin costo adicional.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    {/* [P2-D] Divulgación progresiva: 6 tarjetas a la vista, el resto tras "Ver más" */}
    <div class="flex justify-center mt-6 reveal">
      <button type="button" data-more-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="infraGrid" data-more-open="Ver más" data-more-close="Ver menos" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-2 border-cy/50 dark:border-cy/60 hover:border-cy hover:bg-cy/10 text-cyt font-display font-bold text-[.95rem] px-7 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer">
        <span data-more-label>Ver más</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.4" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current transition-transform aria-expanded:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <noscript><style>[data-more-item]{display:flex!important}</style></noscript>
    <div class="text-center mt-10 reveal"><a href="#hosting-global" class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.95rem] px-10 py-3 rounded-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(255,230,0,.25)]">Ver Hosting Global</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
